WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.400
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.900
⌘-click each task you want to change

3
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.800
…and the next…

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.600
…and one more

5
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.100
The bar counts them

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.600
Change them all at once

7
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.000
In Progress, say

8
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:36.500
All three are In Progress
